msgstr "Zbirajo vsebino za učenje modelov AI. Za prikaz v odgovorih AI niso potrebni, zato je izbira vaša."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/abilities.php:434
msgid "These facts are published in this site’s JSON-LD."
msgstr "Ti podatki so objavljeni v JSON-LD tega spletnega mesta."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1242
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "Pridobivajo vaše strani, da lahko odgovarjajo in jih citirajo. Vaša obstoječa pravila v robots.txt, kot je /wp-admin/, zanje še naprej veljajo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:853
msgid "These hours could not be read day by day, so they will be published exactly as written."
msgstr "Tega delovnega časa ni bilo mogoče prebrati po dnevih, zato bo objavljen točno tako, kot je napisan."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5426
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "Te vrednosti so bile izpeljane iz obstoječih nastavitev in objavljene vsebine. Izpolnjena so bila le prazna polja, zato preverite, ali so vrednosti pravilne."

