msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "Ta koda pripada spletnemu mestu, registriranemu kot %s. Povežite ga s tistega spletnega mesta ali popravite naslov spletnega mesta na nadzorni plošči."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/site-types.php:271
msgid "This decides what is published for AI, what the diagnosis checks and which questions the AI visibility measurement asks. Online shops and B2B sites do not need an address or opening hours."
msgstr "To določa, kaj se objavi za AI, kaj preveri diagnoza in katera vprašanja zastavi merjenje vidnosti v AI. Spletne trgovine in spletna mesta B2B ne potrebujejo naslova ali delovnega časa."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4939
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "To je funkcija beta. Odgovori AI se med zagoni razlikujejo, zato presojajte po trendu in ne po posameznem rezultatu."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5949
