msgid "Waiting for the first measurement. This runs automatically once a week."
msgstr "Čakanje na prvo meritev. Samodejno se izvede enkrat na teden."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4855
msgid "We put representative questions to the AI engines and measure how often your business is mentioned or cited in the answers, how that compares with competitors, and how it moves over time."
msgstr "Sistemom AI postavljamo reprezentativna vprašanja in merimo, kako pogosto je vaše podjetje omenjeno ali navedeno v odgovorih, kako se primerja s konkurenti in kako se to spreminja skozi čas."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:880
msgid "What AI can see"
msgstr "Kaj vidi AI"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5375
msgid "What AI cannot read from this site: %s"
msgstr "Česa AI ne more prebrati s tega spletnega mesta: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:767
msgid "What kind of business is this site for?"
msgstr "Za kakšno dejavnost je to spletno mesto?"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/abilities.php:99
msgid "Whether Nurevo AEO output is on, which outputs are active (JSON-LD, llms.txt, robots.txt rules), the AI training crawler choice, whether the site is connected to nurevo.jp, the plan, and whether diagnosis consent was given."
msgstr "Ali je izpis Nurevo AEO vklopljen, kateri izpisi so dejavni (JSON-LD, llms.txt, pravila robots.txt), izbira za pajke AI za učenje, ali je spletno mesto povezano z nurevo.jp, paket in ali je bila dana privolitev v diagnostiko."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5531
msgid "Which plugin outputs each schema type"
msgstr "Kateri vtičnik izpisuje posamezno vrsto schema"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3915
msgid "With the site connected, the plugin also sends a record of changes to its own settings: which outputs were switched on or off, which business fields were filled in or cleared (not what was entered), the site type, the SEO plugin in use, the plugin version and the number of FAQ entries, services and products. Nurevo uses these records together with AI search measurements, in aggregate across sites, to learn which changes help businesses appear in AI answers."
msgstr "Ko je spletno mesto povezano, vtičnik pošilja tudi zapis sprememb lastnih nastavitev: kateri izhodi so bili vklopljeni ali izklopljeni, katera polja podjetja so bila izpolnjena ali izpraznjena (ne vnesena vsebina), vrsto spletnega mesta, uporabljeni vtičnik SEO, različico vtičnika ter število pogostih vprašanj, storitev in izdelkov. Nurevo te zapise skupaj z meritvami iskanja z UI uporablja združeno za več spletnih mest, da ugotovi, katere spremembe podjetjem pomagajo, da se pojavijo v odgovorih UI."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:783
msgid "WooCommerce is active, so Online shop is suggested. Change it if this site is something else."
msgstr "WooCommerce je aktiven, zato je predlagana »Spletna trgovina«. Spremenite, če je to spletno mesto nekaj drugega."

